{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01763","headline":"杂曲歌辞 长相思三首 一 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 长相思三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长相思，在长安，络纬秋啼金井栏。\n微霜凄凄簟色寒，孤灯不明思欲绝。\n卷帷望月空长叹，美人如花隔云端。\n上有青冥之长天，下有绿水之波澜。\n天长路远魂飞苦，梦魂不到关山难。\n长相思，摧心肝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}